# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, stops the committed
# node_modules (which held macOS binaries) from overwriting what `npm ci`
# installs inside the Linux image.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/dist
**/.pytest_cache

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

*.md
!README.md
